      "procedure": "Residue on ignition (USP <281>): ignite crucible at 600 ± 50 °C 30 min, cool, weigh (W1); weigh 1 g sample (W2); moisten with about 1 mL sulfuric acid, char gently, moisten again, heat until white fumes cease; ignite at 600 ± 50 °C until incinerated; cool, weigh (W3). % residue = (W3 - W1) / W2 x 100; repeat the sulfuric acid/ignition cycle if above limit (weighings within 0.5 mg).",
      "kind": "general",
