    {
      "question": "The spec sheet in this folder ('Specifications sheet Sodium Methyl Paraben') is for Sodium Propyl Paraben (STM-RM-063, issued 17-07-2025), not Crospovidone. Misfiled; ignored. Rows are taken from the STM's own specification lines (USP Crospovidone monograph). Confirm.",
